   'title'=>'Zendesk vs Freshdesk: Which Help Desk Fits?','seo_title'=>'Zendesk vs Freshdesk: Plans, Features and Fit',
   'description'=>'Compare Zendesk and Freshdesk by ticketing, channels, routing, knowledge tools, pricing and migration needs before choosing a help desk.',
   'url'=>'/compare/zendesk-vs-freshdesk/','date'=>'2026-10-27','updated'=>'2026-10-29','status'=>'published',
   'content'=><<<'HTML'
<h2>Quick verdict</h2><p>Choose between Zendesk and Freshdesk by matching the workflow you need to the plan you will actually buy. Zendesk is a strong shortlist candidate for structured ticketing, customer context and a broader suite. Freshdesk is worth comparing for ticketing, shared inbox, customer portal, knowledge base and reporting at published per-agent prices.</p>
<h2>Quick comparison</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Decision</th><th>Zendesk</th><th>Freshdesk</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Entry paid plan</th><td>Support Team US$19/agent/month billed yearly. Checked October 29, 2026. <a href="https://www.zendesk.com/pricing/">Official pricing</a>.</td><td>Growth US$19/agent/month billed annually. Checked October 29, 2026. <a href="https://www.freshworks.com/freshdesk/pricing/">Official pricing</a>.</td></tr><tr><th>Next tier</th><td>Suite Team US$55/agent/month billed yearly. Checked October 29, 2026.</td><td>Pro US$55/agent/month billed annually. Checked October 29, 2026.</td></tr><tr><th>Core capabilities</th><td>Ticketing, routing, customer context, analytics and automation; Suite adds wider channels and knowledge.</td><td>Ticketing, shared inbox, customer portal, knowledge base and reporting; higher tiers add routing and analytics controls.</td></tr><tr><th>AI</th><td>Check exact plan eligibility and current usage terms.</td><td>Current pricing lists included Freddy AI Agent sessions and charges for additional sessions.</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Pricing</h2><p>On October 27, 2026, Zendesk listed Support Team at US$19 and Suite Team at US$55 per agent/month billed yearly. Freshdesk listed Growth at US$19, Pro at US$55 and Enterprise at US$89 per agent/month billed annually. Compare billing commitment, channel coverage, add-ons, included AI usage and seat count. Prices are linked to official vendor pages and can change.</p>
<h2>Ticketing and workflow</h2><p>Both products provide ticketing and team workflows. Zendesk highlights ticket routing, customer context, saved responses, automation and triggers. Freshdesk lists ticketing, shared inbox, customer portal, knowledge base and reporting. The practical difference depends on which plan includes your must-have controls.</p>
<h2>Channels and self-service</h2><p>Zendesk Suite is positioned around broader support channels, messaging, live chat and knowledge. Freshdesk lists customer portal and knowledge features, with multilingual help desk and intelligent routing on higher tiers. Map the required customer journey before migrating.</p>
<h2>Reporting and AI costs</h2><p>Zendesk publishes prebuilt analytics and automation features. Freshdesk lists reporting on Growth and custom dashboards on Pro. Freshworks says new customers on Growth, Pro or Enterprise receive a one-time complimentary 500-session allowance. Extra packs cost US$49 per 100 and are valid for the current billing cycle. See the <a href="https://support.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/50000011515">official AI add-on guide</a>, checked October 29, 2026. Model usage using realistic support volume.</p>
<h2>Migration risks</h2><p>Zendesk documents API-based ticket imports and notes that first reply time and first resolution time are not imported through the documented import path. Before switching, inventory tickets, comments, attachments, users, organizations, custom fields, knowledge articles, triggers, macros and reports. Export a sample, map fields, test import and decide how to preserve history that cannot transfer directly.</p>
<h2>Choose Zendesk if</h2><ul><li>Your plan includes the routing, customer context, automation and reporting you need.</li><li>You require the wider channel coverage in Suite.</li><li>You have confirmed data export and migration requirements.</li></ul>
<h2>Choose Freshdesk if</h2><ul><li>The Growth, Pro or Enterprise feature set matches your ticketing and portal workflow.</li><li>You want explicit annual per-agent prices and a defined AI session allowance.</li><li>Your migration plan preserves the records and processes your team relies on.</li></ul>
<h2>Next steps</h2><p>Read the <a href="/zendesk/pricing/">Zendesk pricing guide</a>, <a href="/zendesk/alternatives/">Zendesk alternatives</a> and <a href="/zendesk/review/">Zendesk review</a>. For the other product, see the <a href="/freshdesk/">Freshdesk hub</a>, <a href="/freshdesk/review/">review</a>, <a href="/freshdesk/pricing/">pricing guide</a> and <a href="/freshdesk/alternatives/">alternatives guide</a>. Confirm current plan details at the <a href="https://www.freshworks.com/freshdesk/pricing/">official Freshdesk pricing page, checked October 29, 2026.</a></p>
HTML
